I am a Ph.D. student in the [https://bair.berkeley.edu Berkeley AI Research (BAIR)] and [https://sky.cs.berkeley.edu Sky Computing] Labs at UC Berkeley, advised by Ion Stoica, Kannan Ramchandran, and Alex Dimakis.

I am also a part of the [https://bliss.eecs.berkeley.edu Berkeley Laboratory for Information and System Sciences (BLISS)] and serve as an organizer of the [https://bliss.eecs.berkeley.edu/Seminar/index.html BLISS Seminar]. Feel free to contact me if you want to participate in our seminar!

My research focuses on efficient machine learning and agentic systems, including multi-agent large language model (LLM) systems, test-time scaling, and discrete generative models.

